WEBVTT

1
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:56,482
Jika O-Ren adalah nomor satu,

2
00:00:56,483 --> 00:00:58,716
Kecuali dia bersikap licik.

3
00:00:58,717 --> 00:01:00,882
Vernita Green akan menjadi nomor dua.

4
00:01:01,283 --> 00:01:02,999
{\an8}Di manakah lokasi Vernita Green?

5
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:03,999
Los Angeles

6
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,082
Vernita di Pasadena.

7
00:01:05,667 --> 00:01:08,582
Tapi wanita yang kamu inginkan akan bersembunyi di motel berbiaya rendah,

8
00:01:08,583 --> 00:01:11,716
15 atau 20 menit lagi untuk naik ke kapal
sebuah pesawat berangkat dari LAX

9
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:14,249
Jika saya harus bertaruh...

10
00:01:14,250 --> 00:01:15,332
Menurutku Hawthorne.

11
00:01:15,917 --> 00:01:16,366
Kalifornia,

12
00:01:16,367 --> 00:01:16,866
Kalifornia,

13
00:01:17,333 --> 00:01:18,449
Ini aku datang.

14
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,366
Saya tidak bisa mencapainya.

15
00:02:20,867 --> 00:02:23,249
Ayolah, nona - hei!
PENGANTIN: Dua turun,

16
00:02:23,250 --> 00:02:24,199
tiga lagi.

17
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:26,449
Itu es krimku.

18
00:02:26,450 --> 00:02:28,149
Kamu sangat jahat.

19
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:40,049
{\an8}Ramuan Bill sendiri.
Dia menyebutnya, "The Blues"

20
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,760
Konnichiwa!

21
00:02:56,570 --> 00:02:57,870
Konnichiwa?

22
00:03:01,944 --> 00:03:03,360
Yuki?

23
00:03:04,317 --> 00:03:05,566
Bingo!

24
00:03:11,617 --> 00:03:13,199
{\an8}Bisakah saya membantu Anda?

25
00:03:14,067 --> 00:03:15,316
{\an8}aku sedang berpikir...

26
00:03:15,317 --> 00:03:18,866
{\an8}Aku sedang berpikir...Aku ingin kamu mati sendiri.

27
00:03:19,533 --> 00:03:21,032
{\an8}Melakukan perjalanan?

28
00:03:21,150 --> 00:03:22,832
{\an8}saya dulu.

29
00:03:23,367 --> 00:03:24,749
{\an8}Kamu masih...

30
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:25,832
SATU ARAH.

31
00:03:28,067 --> 00:03:32,316
{\an8}Aku tahu kamu merasa harus membalaskan dendam adikmu.

32
00:03:32,317 --> 00:03:36,282
{\an8}Tapi aku mohon padamu...

33
00:03:36,283 --> 00:03:38,566
{\an8}Tapi aku mohon.. menjauhlah.

34
00:03:40,367 --> 00:03:42,232
{\an8}Anda menyebutnya mengemis?

35
00:03:43,017 --> 00:03:45,282
{\an8}Anda bisa memohon lebih baik dari itu.

36
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:49,732
{\an8}Bolehkah aku melihat wajahmu?

37
00:03:49,733 --> 00:03:53,449
{\an8}Saya pernah mendengar kecantikan Anda
sangat indah. Saya ingin melihatnya sendiri.

38
00:03:54,567 --> 00:03:55,699
Tentu.

39
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,982
{\an8}Oh... lihat betapa cantiknya wajahmu.

40
00:04:01,983 --> 00:04:03,199
{\an8}Saya ingin menyentuhnya!

41
00:04:03,633 --> 00:04:04,535
{\an8}Terima kasih.

42
00:04:04,584 --> 00:04:06,017
{\an8}Wajahmu cantik sekali.

43
00:04:06,033 --> 00:04:08,767
{\an8}Aku hanya ingin meletakkan
kedua telapak tanganku di pipimu...

44
00:04:08,817 --> 00:04:10,699
{\an8}...dan memberimu ciuman kecil.

45
00:04:14,750 --> 00:04:15,899
{\an8}Bagaimana penampilanku?

46
00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:18,866
{\an8}Sangat cantik.

47
00:04:19,733 --> 00:04:22,766
{\an8}Kamu hanya mengatakan itu karena aku
sudah memberitahumu caranya kamu cantik.

48
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,203
Yuki.

49
00:04:24,517 --> 00:04:26,649
{\an8}Kamu cantik.

50
00:04:26,650 --> 00:04:27,782
{\an8}Benar-benar?!?

51
00:04:28,481 --> 00:04:31,397
{\an8}Begitukah caramu mendeskripsikanku
seseorang jika aku tidak ada di sini?

52
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:34,316
{\an8}Yuki cantik?

53
00:04:35,198 --> 00:04:36,447
Anda yakin.

54
00:04:44,350 --> 00:04:45,432
Yuki.

55
00:04:46,983 --> 00:04:49,232
{\an8}Jangan membuatku membunuhmu.

56
00:04:51,033 --> 00:04:51,982
Oke.

57
00:05:12,467 --> 00:05:15,566
Anda pikir Anda aman?

58
00:05:15,567 --> 00:05:18,199
Ya, kataku.
Ha!

59
00:06:42,867 --> 00:06:45,699
Tetap di rumahmu dan turun ke lantai!

60
00:07:09,649 --> 00:07:12,377
{\an8}Saatnya kelinci keluar dari lubangnya!

61
00:07:45,933 --> 00:07:48,682
Mengerti!

62
00:07:48,683 --> 00:07:50,816
Dasar jalang!

63
00:07:50,817 --> 00:07:52,782
Anda menembak saya di dada saya!

64
00:07:54,317 --> 00:07:56,449
Dasar brengsek!

65
00:07:57,450 --> 00:07:59,949
Sekarang aku akan
selalu punya lesung pipit.

66
00:08:01,650 --> 00:08:03,399
Buat aku kesal!

67
00:08:05,567 --> 00:08:06,699
Yuki!

68
00:08:06,700 --> 00:08:07,816
Dalam waktu sekitar dua menit,

69
00:08:07,817 --> 00:08:09,816
akan ada pasukan polisi di sini.

70
00:08:09,817 --> 00:08:11,399
Jadi jika kamu ingin

71
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:13,199
membunuhku, sekaranglah saatnya.

72
00:08:13,933 --> 00:08:16,932
Jadi apa yang akan terjadi, jalang?

73
00:08:24,733 --> 00:08:26,066
{\an8}******* itu berhasil!

74
00:09:31,950 --> 00:09:34,232
Sial.

75
00:09:34,933 --> 00:09:37,316
Sungguh kucing liar!